        "text": "Foreign. Web3 and the metaverse are often talked about together when people discuss what's next for the Internet. The two concepts are closely related, but they approach the next chapter of the Internet from different perspectives. While Web3 focuses on the relationship between users and information and who controls it, the Metaverse concentrates primarily on how the information is presented and how users experience Web 1.0. Web 2.0, and Web 3 describe the evolution from the read only Web, the read and write Web to read, write and own Web. The Metaverse is an evolution from two previous iterations of the Internet, when users first access primarily text based information, then consumed information in the form of text, images, videos, and real time live streams.",
